WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.796 --> 00:00:04.997
To Ben's relief, Waldo's love spell didn't last long.

2
00:00:05.117 --> 00:00:12.459
Soon everyone stopped fighting and arguing over Waldo.

3
00:00:12.479 --> 00:00:13.480
"Students!" Mr.

4
00:00:13.540 --> 00:00:16.620
Freaky hurried down the hallway.

5
00:00:29.148 --> 00:00:31.389
"Why are you all hanging around the hallway?

6
00:00:31.409 --> 00:00:32.629
Get to class!"

7
00:00:33.709 --> 00:00:37.991
As the monsters started making their way back to their classrooms, Ben glanced at Waldo.

8
00:00:39.051 --> 00:00:40.711
The wizard was scratching his head.

9
00:00:40.731 --> 00:00:44.272
"I wonder why the love spell wore off so quickly.

10
00:00:44.733 --> 00:00:45.573
Maybe I did it wrong."

11
00:00:46.633 --> 00:00:47.713
"Who cares why?"

12
00:00:48.094 --> 00:00:48.674
asked Ben.

13
00:00:48.694 --> 00:00:50.634
"Just be happy that it did.

14
00:00:50.934 --> 00:00:54.475
Otherwise, you'd be married to everyone at Monster Academy by now!"

15
00:00:58.732 --> 00:01:01.073
"Let's go back to the library," said Waldo.

16
00:01:01.093 --> 00:01:03.793
"I'm sure I can come up with another spell."

17
00:01:03.813 --> 00:01:06.394
"Um No thanks."

18
00:01:07.134 --> 00:01:09.535
So far Waldo's magic wasn't much help.

19
00:01:09.555 --> 00:01:12.656
"Maybe later," Ben added quickly.

20
00:01:12.676 --> 00:01:14.836
"Right now I'd better get to class."

21
00:01:17.397 --> 00:01:21.938
He floated off, absentmindedly fingering the tiny toothlike thing in his pocket.

22
00:01:21.958 --> 00:01:23.619
"Now what?"

23
00:01:24.179 --> 00:01:24.779
Ben thought.

24
00:01:25.799 --> 00:01:27.980
Maybe he needed to make a list of suspects.

25
00:01:29.120 --> 00:01:34.004
He didn't really know many kids at Monster Academy, but already one of them was high on his

26
00:01:34.084 --> 00:01:39.909
list—Mog. Winnie had said Mog was nice, but he seemed like a troublemaker to Ben.

27
00:01:40.990 --> 00:01:44.332
So maybe Mog was the one causing all the trouble with the brooms.

28
00:01:47.235 --> 00:01:48.996
The next day at lunch, Mr.

29
00:01:49.056 --> 00:01:53.219
Freaky came into the cafeteria, looking even more nervous than usual.

30
00:01:56.222 --> 00:01:58.764
His three noses were wiggling wildly.

31
00:02:01.156 --> 00:02:03.597
"Everything is totally out of control!"

32
00:02:04.077 --> 00:02:04.597
he cried.

33
00:02:04.617 --> 00:02:08.638
"Today two brooms are missing from the broom-flying classroom.

34
00:02:09.118 --> 00:02:10.959
And we can't find them anywhere!"

35
00:02:12.079 --> 00:02:14.820
Ben shot a look at Mog, who was sitting with Winnie.

36
00:02:15.800 --> 00:02:17.721
But the monster wasn't looking his way.

37
00:02:18.661 --> 00:02:22.122
The broom-flying teacher, Miss Bungle, was on lunch duty.

38
00:02:22.142 --> 00:02:28.303
"Try not to get your noses in an uproar, Mr.

39
00:02:28.343 --> 00:02:30.164
Freaky," said Miss Bungle.

40
00:02:30.924 --> 00:02:34.305
"You know what happens then—they all get stuffed up."

41
00:02:34.325 --> 00:02:41.248
"How can I help it when someone keeps flying the brooms and crashing them all over school?"

42
00:02:41.668 --> 00:02:42.269
cried Mr.

43
00:02:42.309 --> 00:02:45.970
Freaky. "It's a very dangerous situation!"

44
00:02:46.750 --> 00:02:48.371
He stopped to blow his noses.

45
00:02:55.314 --> 00:03:00.116
this problem is solved, I don't want to see anyone near the broom-flying classroom."

46
00:03:01.196 --> 00:03:02.676
Ben glanced at Mog again.

47
00:03:03.857 --> 00:03:06.618
Winnie was laughing at something the big monster was saying.

48
00:03:09.758 --> 00:03:14.260
Suddenly Ben remembered that she'd come into the broom-flying classroom the day before.

49
00:03:15.320 --> 00:03:15.980
What was she—?

50
00:03:17.101 --> 00:03:20.181
Abruptly, Winnie looked up and stared straight back at him.

51
00:03:21.182 --> 00:03:23.142
Ben quickly looked down at his lunch tray.

52
00:03:24.143 --> 00:03:26.123
He hoped she hadn't been reading his mind again.

53
00:03:27.083 --> 00:03:28.984
Then she'd know all about his suspicions!

54
00:03:34.420 --> 00:03:39.925
That night Ben lay in bed, still thinking about Winnie and everything going on at Monster Academy.

55
00:03:41.005 --> 00:03:45.309
The more he thought about the crashing brooms, the more suspicious he was of Mog.

56
00:03:45.329 --> 00:03:48.651
"It can't be Winnie," he told himself.

57
00:03:49.772 --> 00:03:50.913
She was too nice.

58
00:03:52.034 --> 00:03:55.337
And besides, there was no reason for her to cause trouble.

59
00:03:56.418 --> 00:04:01.582
But Mog, meanwhile, was mean and— "Whoo!"

60
00:04:02.242 --> 00:04:02.983
moaned Sid.

61
00:04:03.003 --> 00:04:05.297
"Sid!" Ben snapped.

62
00:04:05.957 --> 00:04:07.638
He looked over at his younger brother.

63
00:04:08.659 --> 00:04:11.981
They had to keep the bedroom totally dark or Sid got scared.

64
00:04:12.962 --> 00:04:14.263
Ben didn't mind the dark.

65
00:04:15.224 --> 00:04:19.447
But tonight Sid was practicing his moaning, which made it hard for Ben to think.

66
00:04:20.788 --> 00:04:24.130
"Whoo!" moaned Sid again.

67
00:04:24.851 --> 00:04:26.572
He was even louder this time.

68
00:04:26.592 --> 00:04:29.334
"Sid, be quiet!"

69
00:04:29.614 --> 00:04:30.174
said Ben.

70
00:04:30.194 --> 00:04:32.276
"I'm trying to concentrate."

71
00:04:33.376 --> 00:04:36.278
"Well, I'm trying to moan," said Sid.

72
00:04:36.298 --> 00:04:38.879
"I want to be really good at it.

73
00:04:39.399 --> 00:04:44.802
Whoo!" Ben put his pillow over his head to muffle the sound.

74
00:04:46.843 --> 00:04:49.765
Eventually, Sid stopped moaning and fell asleep.

75
00:04:50.965 --> 00:04:54.868
Ben's parents had gone to bed too, so at last the house was quiet.

76
00:04:54.888 --> 00:04:57.629
"Proof," thought Ben.

77
00:04:57.649 --> 00:05:00.030
"I need to find some proof."

78
00:05:00.851 --> 00:05:02.952
Before long Ben had formed a plan.

79
00:05:03.968 --> 00:05:06.970
He floated over to the window and quietly slid it open.

80
00:05:08.851 --> 00:05:12.473
Careful not to wake Sid, he sailed out into the moonlit night.

81
00:05:14.354 --> 00:05:16.815
Ben soared high above the streets of Monsterville.

82
00:05:17.855 --> 00:05:22.538
Bats flew silently by, and the moon cast an eerie glow on the rooftops.

83
00:05:23.679 --> 00:05:25.199
Ben looked nervously around.

84
00:05:25.900 --> 00:05:27.340
He hoped he didn't get caught.

85
00:05:28.461 --> 00:05:31.002
Soon he was flying over Monster Academy.

86
00:05:32.023 --> 00:05:33.684
The building was dark and empty.

87
00:05:34.752 --> 00:05:36.914
Ben knew he wouldn't be able to go inside.

88
00:05:38.035 --> 00:05:42.639
He flew around the soccer field, looking for signs of the two missing magic brooms.

89
00:05:43.780 --> 00:05:47.903
He checked the trash area and the bike rack, where Mog seemed to hang out a lot.

90
00:05:49.725 --> 00:05:52.647
But there were no clues anywhere, as far as Ben could tell.

91
00:05:54.589 --> 00:06:01.715
After that, Ben flew all around Monsterville, peering into alleyways, parks, and backyards as he looked for the

92
00:06:01.735 --> 00:06:02.436
missing brooms.

93
00:06:05.088 --> 00:06:08.630
He saw a few brooms, but none of them was from Monster Academy.

94
00:06:09.750 --> 00:06:15.433
He headed toward Mog's neighborhood, which was close to the fence that separated Monsterville from People Place.

95
00:06:16.633 --> 00:06:19.735
Suddenly a loud, angry voice thundered below him.

96
00:06:19.755 --> 00:06:22.156
"What do you think you're doing here?"
